    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "faq-1",
              "name": "text",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "NIMBUS STORE - CUSTOMER SUPPORT KNOWLEDGE BASE\n\nBUSINESS HOURS: Our support team is available Monday to Friday, 9am to 6pm (EST). Live chat is answered within 5 minutes during these hours. Outside hours, tickets are answered the next business day.\n\nSHIPPING: Standard shipping takes 3-5 business days within the US and costs $4.99 (free on orders over $50). Express shipping takes 1-2 business days and costs $14.99. International shipping takes 7-14 business days. You receive a tracking link by email once your order ships.\n\nREFUNDS & RETURNS: We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee. Items must be unused and in original packaging. Refunds are processed to the original payment method within 5-7 business days after we receive the return. To start a return, the customer needs their order number and email. Sale items marked FINAL SALE cannot be returned.\n\nORDER CHANGES & CANCELLATIONS: Orders can be changed or cancelled within 1 hour of purchase. After that the order enters fulfillment and cannot be modified.\n\nACCOUNT HELP: Customers can reset their password from the login page using the Forgot Password link. Account email changes require verifying the old email address.\n\nPAYMENTS: We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, PayPal, and Apple Pay. We do not store full card numbers.\n\nWARRANTY: Electronics carry a 1-year limited warranty covering manufacturing defects. Physical damage and water damage are not covered."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
